<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal insurance premiums rose 24.5 pct Jan-Aug.</title>
<headline>Portugal insurance premiums rose 24.5 pct Jan-Aug.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese insurance premiums rose 24.5 percent in the first eight months of the year to 511.21 billion escudos, the Portuguese Insurance Association (APS) said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Life insurance premiums rose 47.6 percent to 224 billion, accident and sickness insurance rose 9.3 percent to 78.6 billion and car insurance rose 10 percent to 153 billion.</p>
<p>($1=154.37 escudos)</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
